  "notes": "Chromium 160 implements icon-only mode via the HTML content attribute displayhint=\"icon-only\" (plus legacy displaymode=\"icon-only\" alias) on <camera>, <microphone>, and <geolocation> without a reflected IDL property yet. The open W3C PR w3c/mediacapture-extensions#184 proposes enum MediaElementDisplayHint {\"icon\", \"text\", \"icon+text\"} and a reflected IDL attribute; this divergence and the trunk experimental status of CapabilityElementIconOnlyMode are explicitly documented."
